Privacy Policy for Discovery Workshop
Effective Date: November 16, 2026

This Privacy Policy describes how Discovery Workshop ("we," "our," or "us") handles information in connection with the Discovery Workshop mobile application (the "App").

1. No Data Collection
We respect your privacy. Discovery Workshop is designed to operate without collecting, storing, transmitting, or processing any personal information or user data.

We do not require you to create an account or provide personal details (such as your name, email address, phone number, or location) to use the App.

We do not track your usage, device identifiers, IP address, or analytics.

Any preferences, notes, or settings you configure within the App remain stored locally on your device and are never transmitted to us.

2. Third-Party Services
Discovery Workshop does not integrate with any third-party analytics providers, advertising networks, or external services that collect, track, or distribute user data.

3. Data Sharing
Because we do not collect any user data, we do not sell, rent, trade, or share any personal information with third parties.

4. Children's Privacy
Because the App does not collect any personal information from anyone, it does not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13 (or the applicable age of digital consent in your jurisdiction).

5. Changes to This Privacy Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time—for example, if we introduce new online features in future versions of the App. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.

